# SoulSilver USA: IPGE, revision 0. Emulator-handled Action Replay code.
# Berry pocket base and pointer guard from libretro-database's "Berries" code:
# https://github.com/libretro/libretro-database/blob/master/cht/Nintendo%20-%20Nintendo%20DS/Pokemon%20-%20SoulSilver%20Version%20%28USA%29.cht
# Oran Berry = item 155 (0x009B), verified in:
# https://github.com/pret/pokeheartgold/blob/master/include/constants/items.h
# Replaces ONLY the first berry stack with 5 Oran Berries (does not add 5).
# Save in-game first. Load Cheat File (Append), enable, and Apply Changes.
# Resume and press DS L+R (Xbox LB+RB), then release and reopen the bag.
# Disable and Apply Changes before feeding Moomoo or rearranging the bag.
# Moomoo needs 7 Oran Berries total; repeat the refill if more are needed.
